# less-sheet GTK4 / libadwaita frontend — C coding style.
#
# Canonical GNOME/GTK C style: BasedOnStyle GNU (2-space indent, braces on their
# own indented line, space before call parens, ~79-col lines). This is the correct
# high-quality standard for GTK C, not a low-churn pick. Enforced by the apps/gtk
# quality gate: `clang-format --dry-run -Werror` over src/*.c + the real
# include/lsg_*.h headers (the include/lesssheet.h symlink to the root api/ header
# is deliberately NOT covered here — it is owned by the root api/ surface).
BasedOnStyle: GNU
